                  "stick": [
                    0.6,
                    -0.8
                  ],
                  "frame": "LD",
                  "hold": 1
                },
                {
                  "press": "R",
                  "frame": "LD",
                  "hold": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Air dodge onto the stage",
        "text": [
          "Once {char} has risen above the stage, an air dodge down and toward it touches down at once, and {char} lands in 10 frames of landing lag. For {char} that is frame {LD}, counting the let-go as 1. Pressed earlier, while {char} is still below the stage, the air dodge hits its side and {char} falls helpless. Aim the stick about 45 degrees below level. Mewtwo needs a steeper angle, about 53 degrees: at 45 his air dodge touches down a frame later, and none of his invincibility is left after the landing lag.",
          "Invincibility left after the 10 frames of landing lag is time {char} can act and cannot be hit. Each frame of delay before the double jump or the air dodge takes a frame from it. How much is left depends on the double jump: Peach's sinks before it rises, so none of hers is left after the landing lag, and this drill is not offered for her."
        ],
